target: skills/review/review-loop/review-stats.py
verify: cd skills/review/review-loop && ./review-stats.test.sh
expect: a deliberate skip is not reported as a failure to complete
why:    a gate the run accounted for and a gate it never reported need different fixes, and merging the counters reported correct behaviour as failure — all five of the alarm's reported misses of record_reviewed were of this kind
--- old
            if st in DROP_STATES:
                dropped[g] += 1
            else:
                declined[g] += 1
                why[g].add(st)
--- new
            dropped[g] += 1
            why[g].add(st)
